"or ''\">Follow-up for Project proposal</strong> <t t-"
"if=\"event_organizer\">organized by </t><t t-out=\"event_organizer or "
"''\">Colleen Diaz</t> has been canceled and removed from your calendar.\n"
"        </span>\n"
